## Team-owned installed preview persistence and isolated examples witness.
app PreviewPersistence
Given
 Supply { name:text, quantity:int }
 policy Supply read=members
 fixture editable=Supply {name="Example fixture",quantity=4}
When
 crud Supply by=members fields=name,quantity
  examples update record=editable
   as,changes.name,changes.quantity -> record.name,record.quantity
   other,"Example-only mutation",8 -> "Example-only mutation",8
   outsider,"Private mutation",9 -> error(forbidden)
Then
 page / title="Persistent preview"
